WEBVTT

01:29.440 --> 01:34.289
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.890 --> 01:37.860
[Episode 23]

01:40.950 --> 01:42.509
So, according to what you're sharing,

01:42.509 --> 01:44.870
the transition back home is difficult.

01:44.870 --> 01:48.590
You think you're experiencing
the same symptoms again?

01:48.610 --> 01:49.130
Yes.

01:49.920 --> 01:50.509
I mean,

01:52.000 --> 01:53.800
I did go through crazy jet lag.

01:53.729 --> 01:57.200
[The microphone is on.]
[The speaker is on.] [The camera is on.]

01:54.759 --> 01:55.680
But

01:56.890 --> 01:57.650
I do feel

01:57.680 --> 01:59.610
the symptoms are occurring again.

02:00.870 --> 02:02.560
But it's not as bad as before.

02:04.630 --> 02:05.930
At least,

02:06.920 --> 02:09.070
I can sleep well now.

02:10.389 --> 02:11.160
I see.

02:11.790 --> 02:14.480
Have you taken notes when it happened?

02:14.500 --> 02:17.160
How frequent when you
describe these episodes?

02:17.230 --> 02:17.780
Yeah.

02:19.560 --> 02:20.490
Just once.

02:22.390 --> 02:23.390
And

02:24.950 --> 02:28.220
[The microphone is on]
[The speaker is on] [The camera is on.]

02:26.570 --> 02:27.520
I saw her again.

02:30.829 --> 02:32.630
It's worth remembering that ten years ago,

02:32.630 --> 02:33.630
at the highest level,
you discovered by yourself that

02:33.630 --> 02:35.079
journaling

02:35.079 --> 02:37.750
provided relief.

02:38.510 --> 02:40.360
This is what you have.

02:40.640 --> 02:42.570
Maybe it's worth picking up again.

03:04.470 --> 03:06.710
May 28, 2026.

03:07.240 --> 03:08.000
Sunny.

03:10.260 --> 03:12.330
I've imagined

03:13.030 --> 03:15.560
the scene where we met again
countless times.

03:16.520 --> 03:17.870
But I never thought

03:18.760 --> 03:21.050
the most unrealistic dream

03:21.360 --> 03:23.210
will come true in this way.

03:25.070 --> 03:26.600
She's the same as I remember.

03:26.600 --> 03:28.070
She hasn't changed at all.

03:28.960 --> 03:30.890
But how could she not change at all?

03:33.130 --> 03:33.750
As if

03:33.750 --> 03:35.190
nothing happened.

03:37.240 --> 03:38.150
If so,

03:39.970 --> 03:41.660
I would rather this reunion

03:42.450 --> 03:44.800
be just another dream of mine.

03:51.820 --> 03:53.340
How long has it been?

03:55.280 --> 03:56.150
Ten years.

03:57.030 --> 03:58.140
But I know

03:58.220 --> 04:00.630
Ms. Qilan has always been
concerned about me.

04:00.630 --> 04:03.430
And you know me well.

04:04.320 --> 04:06.260
I don't need to introduce myself.

04:08.760 --> 04:09.760
You know

04:10.130 --> 04:12.460
I'm not the one
who really cares about you.

04:14.580 --> 04:15.940
I came to you today

04:16.269 --> 04:17.160
to make a deal

04:17.160 --> 04:18.360
with you.

04:21.290 --> 04:22.160
The bidding for the resort's
Phase II project

04:22.160 --> 04:24.070
has already concluded.

04:24.840 --> 04:27.040
The group should choose

04:27.070 --> 04:27.870
the person in charge

04:27.870 --> 04:29.470
of the Phase II project team.

04:29.900 --> 04:31.750
Ms. Qilan, though you've

04:31.800 --> 04:33.730
gained a solid position in Lan Yue,

04:33.890 --> 04:36.159
Lu Zhongyue is still powerful.

04:37.430 --> 04:39.190
I'm afraid

04:40.600 --> 04:41.390
you're not 100% sure that

04:41.390 --> 04:43.590
you will be the person in charge, right?

04:44.620 --> 04:46.380
So, do you have any ideas?

04:48.850 --> 04:50.770
I have some materials

04:50.800 --> 04:52.700
regarding the previous collaborations

04:52.700 --> 04:55.120
between Lu Zhongyue
and Boxing Construction.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.190
I have more,

04:57.180 --> 04:58.520
including recent
private communication records

04:58.520 --> 05:00.270
between him

05:00.270 --> 05:03.130
and the senior management of
Boxing Construction.

05:03.720 --> 05:05.850
I think you may be interested in these.

05:20.660 --> 05:22.320
Looks like you came prepared.

05:24.610 --> 05:25.940
What's your condition?

05:28.650 --> 05:29.240
I want to join

05:29.240 --> 05:31.440
the Phase II project team of the resort.

05:32.370 --> 05:33.190
This project

05:33.190 --> 05:34.270
will be the benchmark

05:34.270 --> 05:35.159
in Pingchuan.

05:36.000 --> 05:37.900
If I can continue to
participate in this project,

05:37.900 --> 05:39.360
I'll get a lot of benefits.

05:40.880 --> 05:42.730
Besides, my joining the project team

05:42.730 --> 05:43.800
means I'll be transferred

05:43.800 --> 05:46.260
from the subsidiaries to the headquarters.

05:46.890 --> 05:48.550
To some extent, I'm promoted.

05:53.630 --> 05:55.360
You've been in Boxing Construction
for so many years.

05:55.360 --> 05:57.420
But you didn't propose to
join the headquarters.

05:57.420 --> 05:58.860
At this time,

05:59.040 --> 06:00.770
I have to suspect your motive.

06:02.070 --> 06:03.870
Besides,

06:04.030 --> 06:05.080
if you tell Xixiao your ideas,

06:05.080 --> 06:06.340
this will definitely be done.

06:06.340 --> 06:08.270
Do you have to beat around the bush?

06:11.400 --> 06:12.860
I'm not doing this for him.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.360
But Xixiao is now

06:17.360 --> 06:19.090
one of Lan Yue's shareholders.

06:19.110 --> 06:21.640
And he's the director of
the Phase II project.

06:21.800 --> 06:22.920
So, as for the matter of
whether you can join

06:22.920 --> 06:23.720
the Phase II project team,

06:23.720 --> 06:24.560
I do not

06:24.560 --> 06:25.620
have the final say.

06:45.750 --> 06:47.270
Why are you so impatient?

06:47.270 --> 06:48.120
You came here immediately

06:48.120 --> 06:49.250
for the latest news?

06:51.040 --> 06:52.300
Why did she come to you?

06:53.950 --> 06:55.560
She wanted to join
the Phase II project team.

06:55.560 --> 06:56.620
But I rejected her.

06:58.070 --> 06:59.680
I know you got involved

06:59.680 --> 07:00.870
because of her.

07:00.950 --> 07:02.360
So, before I know

07:02.380 --> 07:03.620
your thoughts,

07:03.740 --> 07:04.940
I won't say yes to her.

07:07.500 --> 07:08.400
What's wrong?

07:09.030 --> 07:10.420
You're not satisfied with what I did?

07:10.420 --> 07:11.290
No.

07:12.720 --> 07:13.720
I'm just curious

07:13.720 --> 07:14.600
why she is so obsessed

07:14.600 --> 07:16.330
with joining the project team.

07:16.480 --> 07:18.160
In Pingchuan,

07:18.300 --> 07:19.390
a project as large as

07:19.390 --> 07:20.600
the Phase II project

07:20.810 --> 07:21.940
appeared

07:21.960 --> 07:23.360
20 years ago.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.450
It was the Phase I project of the resort.

07:25.450 --> 07:27.800
Everyone in our industry

07:27.830 --> 07:29.310
wants to get involved.

07:30.720 --> 07:32.380
She's not that kind of person.

07:37.159 --> 07:38.340
People do change.

07:39.159 --> 07:40.430
Moreover,

07:40.430 --> 07:42.480
she has always been a sophisticated girl.

07:42.480 --> 07:45.000
She's even more sophisticated now.

07:50.050 --> 07:51.250
Did she come to you

07:52.380 --> 07:53.440
empty-handed?

07:55.140 --> 07:57.460
Her offer is really attractive.

07:58.710 --> 08:00.170
So, what are you thinking?

08:00.200 --> 08:01.130
Let her in or not?

08:11.080 --> 08:13.430
Brat, be careful not to burn yourself.

08:23.610 --> 08:24.410
Alright.

08:23.850 --> 08:27.500
[Big Dream Studio]

08:24.990 --> 08:25.720
Meng,

08:25.740 --> 08:26.920
this new artist

08:26.920 --> 08:28.720
fits the market of young people.

08:28.950 --> 08:30.160
Is there any shortage of

08:30.160 --> 08:31.270
work?

08:31.570 --> 08:33.390
-Yes, it lacks substance.
-Then, no.

08:33.390 --> 08:34.390
No, no.

08:34.690 --> 08:35.360
Meng.

08:35.409 --> 08:36.340
Look at this one.

08:36.580 --> 08:37.679
He has a lot of great works.

08:37.679 --> 08:39.340
And he is also an avant-garde.

08:39.480 --> 08:41.000
The vanguard represents controversy.

08:41.000 --> 08:42.630
Controversy means risk.

08:42.630 --> 08:44.550
It's too risky.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.600
Then, no.

08:45.730 --> 08:46.590
What about you?

08:47.000 --> 08:48.480
Meng, look at this.

08:48.480 --> 08:49.200
This artist.

08:49.200 --> 08:50.030
The New Year interview of "West Wind"

08:50.030 --> 08:51.030
also invited him.

08:52.180 --> 08:54.010
Both of us create contact for
WeChat official accounts.

08:54.010 --> 08:55.440
If we invite the people our rivals used,

08:55.440 --> 08:57.080
no matter how good this content is,
we'll be regarded as following the wind.

08:57.080 --> 08:57.840
Yes, follow the wind.

08:57.840 --> 08:59.440
-No. It’s used.
-Don’t follow the wind.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.710
We can't use what others used.

09:00.260 --> 09:01.590
[Expired defective products]

09:02.990 --> 09:04.360
Our account has been updated

09:03.990 --> 09:04.550
[Expired defective products]

09:04.360 --> 09:05.360
in the middle of

09:05.380 --> 09:06.210
every month.

09:06.510 --> 09:07.870
We have to find the interviewee.

09:07.870 --> 09:08.790
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

09:08.790 --> 09:09.510
These artists

09:09.510 --> 09:10.670
are hard to deal with.

09:10.670 --> 09:11.150
How about

09:11.150 --> 09:12.670
lowering the requirements?

09:12.670 --> 09:14.070
Lower the requirements?

09:14.550 --> 09:15.550
What do you think?

09:15.830 --> 09:17.430
Meng, Mr. Jiang called.

09:17.460 --> 09:19.200
Can't you see I'm busy?

09:19.220 --> 09:20.680
You even called my studio?

09:20.790 --> 09:21.390
I'm hanging up.

09:21.390 --> 09:22.390
Don't hang up.

09:22.410 --> 09:23.810
I have work to talk to you.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.350
Go ahead.

09:32.920 --> 09:34.530
Meng, I'm done.

09:34.560 --> 09:35.560
It's your turn.

09:51.390 --> 09:53.320
Anything wrong with your stomach?

09:59.480 --> 10:00.270
Although I can

10:00.270 --> 10:01.320
continue my cooperation with advertisers

10:01.320 --> 10:02.200
for two more quarters,

10:02.200 --> 10:03.320
we didn't gain

10:03.320 --> 10:04.320
many followers.

10:04.320 --> 10:05.550
Lu Xixiao is the most popular

10:05.550 --> 10:07.120
and the most famous candidate.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.830
[The first snow, regretful
art exhibition]

10:07.260 --> 10:08.390
But if my friend

10:08.390 --> 10:09.030
doesn't agree,

10:09.030 --> 10:09.790
I won't say yes

10:09.790 --> 10:11.390
even if he invests with cash.

10:11.410 --> 10:12.320
And his condition is that

10:12.320 --> 10:13.450
you have to be there.

10:14.710 --> 10:16.150
I have a stomachache.

10:19.500 --> 10:20.140
Wan.

10:20.160 --> 10:21.290
If you don't agree,

10:21.310 --> 10:22.240
don't go.

10:23.090 --> 10:24.870
After all, work is for survival.

10:24.870 --> 10:26.000
You are my true love.

10:29.770 --> 10:31.940
[The first snow, regretful
art exhibition]

10:35.730 --> 10:37.260
Anything is fine. Up to you.

10:40.320 --> 10:40.790
Okay.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.920
Most of the artists

10:43.940 --> 10:44.580
wear

10:44.610 --> 10:46.160
unconventional clothes.

10:46.180 --> 10:47.150
But L

10:47.180 --> 10:50.040
is so handsome that
he doesn't need any extra decorations.

10:50.040 --> 10:51.080
Not only handsome,

10:51.080 --> 10:51.870
but I also heard that

10:51.870 --> 10:53.500
there is a big enterprise in his family.

10:53.500 --> 10:54.530
And he's still single.

10:54.530 --> 10:55.240
He is

10:55.240 --> 10:56.280
a golden bachelor.

10:56.280 --> 10:58.960
How could he be single?

10:59.390 --> 11:00.550
Maybe he has a marriage partner

11:00.550 --> 11:01.650
who wants to keep a low profile.

11:01.650 --> 11:03.080
Or perhaps he has too many girlfriends,

11:03.080 --> 11:04.700
but he doesn't want to
admit any of them as his girlfriend.

11:04.700 --> 11:06.940
Okay. Lower your head
and look at the ground.

11:06.940 --> 11:08.350
Cool!

11:10.240 --> 11:11.500
Not bad.

11:13.550 --> 11:14.550
You're here.

11:14.570 --> 11:15.840
Why didn't you tell me?

11:16.910 --> 11:19.240
Go on with your work.
Don't worry about me.

11:20.730 --> 11:21.830
Okay, take a rest.

11:24.880 --> 11:25.880
Thank you.

11:28.030 --> 11:28.670
Coffee.

11:29.910 --> 11:31.040
-Your phone.
-Look.

11:31.440 --> 11:33.300
-That's so you.
-Look at this one.

11:33.690 --> 11:35.220
His smile is so attractive.

11:35.650 --> 11:36.720
He was the prettiest

11:36.720 --> 11:37.420
in our high school.

11:37.420 --> 11:37.970
Right?

11:39.120 --> 11:40.120
You did a good job.

11:40.780 --> 11:43.120
Why are you praising yourself?

11:43.690 --> 11:44.730
Our shooting lasts

11:44.730 --> 11:46.030
only half an hour.

11:46.930 --> 11:49.530
This is the eighth time that
he talked with her.

11:49.780 --> 11:50.940
What do you think?

11:51.720 --> 11:53.390
He doesn't look like a good person.

11:53.390 --> 11:55.470
We can directly use this picture.

11:55.840 --> 11:57.590
He probably doesn't know

11:57.860 --> 11:59.720
you're Gu Meng's husband, right?

12:01.860 --> 12:03.660
Are you going to just watch here?

12:05.250 --> 12:06.040
Hello.

12:07.340 --> 12:08.140
Hello.

12:09.670 --> 12:11.140
I'm L's manager.

12:09.960 --> 12:11.020
[Jiang Fan]

12:13.410 --> 12:14.940
Gu Meng

12:15.260 --> 12:16.360
is my old friend.

12:16.440 --> 12:17.970
You two work well together.

12:18.570 --> 12:19.380
Yes.

12:19.410 --> 12:21.340
I've been working with Meng
for a long time.

12:21.340 --> 12:22.870
She acknowledges my taste.

12:22.970 --> 12:23.630
I admire

12:23.630 --> 12:24.690
her working state.

12:25.790 --> 12:26.590
I'll go now.

12:26.720 --> 12:27.360
Okay.

12:32.220 --> 12:33.700
If you really care about me,

12:33.700 --> 12:34.790
you wouldn't stand here

12:34.790 --> 12:35.870
and talk nonsense.

12:36.920 --> 12:38.450
How can I not care about you?

12:38.740 --> 12:39.480
I just think

12:39.480 --> 12:40.140
I should give you enough

12:40.140 --> 12:41.070
personal space.

12:41.180 --> 12:41.910
Well, the space you offer

12:41.910 --> 12:43.080
is too large.

12:43.300 --> 12:43.980
I can only meet you

12:43.980 --> 12:45.320
a few times a year.

12:47.050 --> 12:47.760
Forget it.

12:47.790 --> 12:49.850
I don't want to argue with you at work.

12:51.620 --> 12:52.980
Yes, it's a workplace.

12:54.210 --> 12:54.940
You should

12:54.970 --> 12:56.500
communicate with the photographer

12:56.500 --> 12:57.470
you admire.

13:00.210 --> 13:00.920
Of course.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.000
At least he

13:03.030 --> 13:05.160
will always clear his schedule for me.

13:10.460 --> 13:11.840
Old friend?

13:15.550 --> 13:16.830
Is she your classmate?

13:19.830 --> 13:21.090
We are all classmates.

13:21.550 --> 13:22.210
I'll leave.

13:32.900 --> 13:33.590
Okay.

13:34.270 --> 13:35.270
Okay, look at me.

13:36.610 --> 13:37.650
Okay.

13:37.670 --> 13:39.760
One, two, three. Done.

13:55.470 --> 13:56.510
Hello, everyone.

13:56.510 --> 13:58.240
Welcome to "Wake up from Dream".

13:58.240 --> 13:59.320
I'm Gu Meng.

13:59.630 --> 14:00.480
Today,

14:00.480 --> 14:01.670
we have invited

14:01.670 --> 14:04.120
a handsome

14:04.120 --> 14:05.840
and mysterious guy.

14:05.820 --> 14:10.010
[Wake up from Dream]

14:05.840 --> 14:07.840
Let's welcome our great painter, L.

14:08.910 --> 14:10.200
Hello, I'm L.

14:10.380 --> 14:11.200
I'm very happy to come to

14:11.200 --> 14:12.400
"Wake up from Dream."

14:12.440 --> 14:13.550
As you all know,

14:13.550 --> 14:14.510
L's paintings

14:14.510 --> 14:16.030
are very popular.

14:16.120 --> 14:18.550
But you are very mysterious and low-key.

14:16.960 --> 14:22.910
[Wake up from Dream]

14:19.030 --> 14:20.790
It's a pleasure

14:20.790 --> 14:22.240
for "Wake up from Dream"

14:22.260 --> 14:23.920
to have your interview debut.

14:25.060 --> 14:26.420
You're welcome.

14:26.510 --> 14:28.630
After all, you paid a lot.

14:32.510 --> 14:34.080
As far as we know,

14:34.100 --> 14:35.320
you went abroad to study

14:34.160 --> 14:37.710
[Wake up from Dream]

14:35.320 --> 14:37.790
many years ago.

14:38.000 --> 14:39.030
This time,

14:39.030 --> 14:40.840
you are holding an art exhibition here

14:40.840 --> 14:42.030
since you want to

14:42.030 --> 14:44.430
shift your career's focus to China, right?

14:50.390 --> 14:51.840
Actually, I didn't plan to do so.

14:51.840 --> 14:52.630
But

14:54.250 --> 14:56.030
I've been thinking about it lately.

14:56.030 --> 14:56.750
Why did you

14:56.750 --> 14:58.320
change your mind?

14:59.460 --> 15:00.440
There's someone

15:00.440 --> 15:01.550
who owes me.

15:03.340 --> 15:04.320
When I came back,

15:04.320 --> 15:05.720
I found she's doing well.

15:07.400 --> 15:09.000
So I'm thinking

15:10.000 --> 15:12.000
whether I should let her pay me back.

15:12.750 --> 15:13.870
L is

15:13.870 --> 15:15.320
very humorous.

15:15.350 --> 15:16.630
He used a simple sentence

15:16.630 --> 15:17.910
to make all of us curious.

15:17.910 --> 15:19.000
I'm not kidding.

15:19.840 --> 15:20.910
I'm serious.

15:24.180 --> 15:25.200
Let's go back

15:25.200 --> 15:26.240
to your works.

15:26.790 --> 15:27.630
Your paintings

15:27.630 --> 15:29.270
often show winter and snow

15:29.270 --> 15:31.600
in an abstract way.

15:31.630 --> 15:32.630
The ground note is dark,

15:32.630 --> 15:33.960
and the touch is broken.

15:34.150 --> 15:34.790
In the pictures,

15:34.790 --> 15:36.030
there are

15:36.030 --> 15:37.600
incomplete blanks,

15:37.720 --> 15:38.480
providing

15:38.480 --> 15:40.000
a very lonely

15:40.080 --> 15:41.550
and painful feeling.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.120
How did this unique style

15:43.120 --> 15:44.360
form?

15:47.410 --> 15:48.200
Actually, I've never

15:48.200 --> 15:49.240
liked winter.

15:51.380 --> 15:52.440
Because when I was young,

15:52.440 --> 15:53.840
I lost someone important

15:54.720 --> 15:56.000
in winter.

15:58.080 --> 15:58.720
Later,

15:58.720 --> 15:59.960
a girl showed up.

16:00.840 --> 16:01.910
She made me feel that

16:01.910 --> 16:04.440
winter can be a beautiful,

16:04.860 --> 16:07.340
happy,

16:10.200 --> 16:11.240
and warm season.

16:16.030 --> 16:17.150
Later,

16:20.150 --> 16:21.880
she pushed me back to the abyss.

16:23.510 --> 16:24.600
So my only impression of winter

16:24.600 --> 16:26.840
is pain,

16:28.290 --> 16:29.020
regret,

16:30.430 --> 16:31.230
and missing.

16:34.150 --> 16:35.000
Maybe this is

16:35.000 --> 16:36.260
how I created my style.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.510
Thank you

16:40.510 --> 16:42.080
for sharing

16:42.080 --> 16:43.270
the story behind.

16:43.390 --> 16:44.440
Next question.

16:44.630 --> 16:46.480
Many audiences and art lovers

16:46.480 --> 16:48.080
are very interested in this.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.440
As for the series of "First Snow" series

16:49.440 --> 16:50.960
you treasure a lot,

16:50.960 --> 16:52.630
two works have been completed.

16:52.630 --> 16:55.030
When can we

16:55.030 --> 16:55.750
see

16:55.750 --> 16:57.030
all the works?

16:58.700 --> 16:59.750
It won't be long.

17:01.270 --> 17:03.320
We're looking forward to it.

17:17.500 --> 17:18.480
Why did you come out

17:18.480 --> 17:20.339
before finishing the interview?

17:20.510 --> 17:21.440
You feel guilty?

17:23.410 --> 17:25.010
I came out for some fresh air.

17:28.760 --> 17:29.560
Zhou Wan,

17:31.000 --> 17:32.730
have you ever regretted it

17:33.310 --> 17:35.170
in the ten years since we broke up?

17:39.020 --> 17:40.300
Nope.

17:46.070 --> 17:46.640
Okay.

17:46.750 --> 17:47.440
What are you doing?

17:47.440 --> 17:48.110
Don't you want to join

17:48.110 --> 17:49.330
the Phase II project team?

17:49.330 --> 17:50.830
Only I can help you now.

17:50.850 --> 17:52.510
I'll only give you one chance.

18:13.970 --> 18:14.970
Come out. Get off.

18:20.560 --> 18:21.230
Hurry.

18:29.430 --> 18:30.430
I can walk myself.

18:45.670 --> 18:47.330
What exactly do you want to do?

18:55.590 --> 18:58.640
Be my model and cooperate with me.

18:59.440 --> 19:01.700
Then, I'll let you join the project team.

19:04.480 --> 19:05.480
Stand over there.

19:21.000 --> 19:21.930
What do you mean?

19:22.510 --> 19:23.510
Didn't I tell you?

19:24.160 --> 19:25.920
I want you to be my model.

19:31.750 --> 19:32.680
All these years,

19:33.000 --> 19:34.260
you're still the same.

19:47.010 --> 19:48.610
Do you think you know me well?

19:54.440 --> 19:56.640
I let you be a model because it was handy.

19:57.830 --> 19:58.400
Do you think

19:58.400 --> 20:00.060
you can bring me inspiration?

20:03.790 --> 20:04.590
Did you ask me here

20:04.590 --> 20:05.830
to hear this?

20:12.310 --> 20:13.570
Is that all you've got?

20:22.100 --> 20:23.010
Zhou Wan,

20:23.220 --> 20:24.240
how could you be

20:24.240 --> 20:24.960
so self-righteous

20:24.960 --> 20:25.830
in front of me?

20:27.480 --> 20:28.200
No matter how we analyze

20:28.200 --> 20:29.180
what happened back then,

20:29.180 --> 20:31.180
you're the one who let me down.

20:32.770 --> 20:34.290
How could you do so?

20:45.370 --> 20:46.510
What do you want?

20:50.680 --> 20:51.930
What do I want?

20:53.400 --> 20:55.210
I want you to be my assistant

20:57.550 --> 20:59.060
and cooperate with me.

21:03.990 --> 21:05.010
Okay.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.240
Do you have to go?

21:45.240 --> 21:47.100
It's like a lamb to the slaughter.

21:47.720 --> 21:49.110
I owe him this.

21:49.350 --> 21:50.160
If I don't go,

21:50.180 --> 21:51.460
he will still pester me.

21:51.460 --> 21:52.400
Your orange.

21:53.960 --> 21:55.310
Let me remind you.

21:55.640 --> 21:58.240
Entanglement will make you
fall into the trap again.

21:58.240 --> 21:59.570
It will not bring an end.

22:01.240 --> 22:02.350
You, a person who devoiced,

22:02.350 --> 22:04.050
really talked differently, huh?

22:04.050 --> 22:05.650
I'm in a cooling-off period.

22:07.150 --> 22:08.650
I have a to-be-ex-wife.

22:10.100 --> 22:11.870
Let me tell you one more thing.

22:12.310 --> 22:13.550
Sometimes,

22:13.580 --> 22:15.440
I hope Jiang Fan is not doing well,

22:15.440 --> 22:17.400
but if I meet him,

22:17.400 --> 22:18.480
I'll go around.

22:19.200 --> 22:21.260
But you can't get away with Lu Xixiao.

22:22.460 --> 22:24.120
He still has feelings for you.

22:25.570 --> 22:27.960
Even if he does, he must hate me.

22:30.200 --> 22:31.550
I don't care what happens to him,

22:31.550 --> 22:31.960
since I have

22:31.960 --> 22:33.560
more important things to do.

22:35.640 --> 22:36.440
What do you want to do?

22:36.440 --> 22:38.240
Does it have a conflict with him?

22:38.680 --> 22:39.400
Yes.

22:40.240 --> 22:41.030
Describe it.

22:46.020 --> 22:47.420
More dramatic than this.

22:49.330 --> 22:51.390
That's something a monster would do.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.480
That's why you like it.

23:01.160 --> 23:02.920
Don't move. I want to see.

23:06.510 --> 23:08.110
It's time for you to move out.

23:12.190 --> 23:13.340
Are you a monster?

23:13.550 --> 23:14.440
I was just separated.

23:14.440 --> 23:15.290
I was hit by my rival in love.

23:15.290 --> 23:17.620
But you kicked me out
to stay on the street?

23:18.150 --> 23:18.720
Your wedding house

23:18.720 --> 23:20.320
hasn't been sold yet, right?

23:21.270 --> 23:22.720
That's empty.

23:22.720 --> 23:23.880
There's no furniture inside.

23:23.880 --> 23:25.160
Can you live there?

23:25.680 --> 23:27.740
Are you really willing to kick me out?

23:28.240 --> 23:29.440
Zhou Wan is moving in.

23:30.300 --> 23:31.110
Hurry up.

23:33.680 --> 23:34.610
Are you serious?

23:43.160 --> 23:44.900
Depression?

23:44.930 --> 23:47.120
Someone is homeless.

23:47.440 --> 23:50.170
When your girlfriend comes,
you give up your bro.

23:52.480 --> 23:53.070
Xixiao.

23:54.310 --> 23:55.270
Don't let her go.

23:55.790 --> 23:56.680
She owes you

23:57.240 --> 23:59.040
for all these years. Time to pay.

24:02.110 --> 24:04.510
Xiaoliu, I'm leaving.

24:05.000 --> 24:07.150
Lu Xixiao is worse than you.

24:07.550 --> 24:09.030
Take care of yourself.

24:35.920 --> 24:38.290
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

24:39.390 --> 24:41.360
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

24:44.060 --> 24:46.110
♪ I think you would understand ♪

24:47.420 --> 24:50.470
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

24:49.640 --> 24:50.700
Come here tomorrow

24:52.010 --> 24:53.450
and move in with me.

24:52.150 --> 24:54.590
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

24:55.380 --> 24:58.400
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

24:59.030 --> 25:02.230
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

24:59.130 --> 25:00.380
As what?

25:00.700 --> 25:02.100
Your special assistant?

25:02.610 --> 25:04.580
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

25:03.130 --> 25:04.920
As my girlfriend.

25:06.110 --> 25:07.070
How about this weekend?

25:07.070 --> 25:08.400
I need to pack up.

25:08.060 --> 25:10.430
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

25:11.300 --> 25:12.240
The day after tomorrow is the deadline.

25:11.460 --> 25:13.520
♪ An astronomer ♪

25:15.960 --> 25:18.520
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

25:19.290 --> 25:22.690
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

25:20.030 --> 25:20.640
Okay.

25:23.990 --> 25:26.460
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

25:27.410 --> 25:30.380
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

25:30.920 --> 25:34.290
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

25:34.930 --> 25:40.000
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

25:41.830 --> 25:43.770
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

25:43.920 --> 25:45.820
♪ No time left, so I ♪

25:45.910 --> 25:48.900
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

25:49.890 --> 25:52.670
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

25:52.740 --> 25:56.740
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

25:58.020 --> 26:00.650
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

26:00.750 --> 26:04.470
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

26:00.770 --> 26:02.270
Someone anonymously reported

26:02.270 --> 26:03.350
that Mr. Lu

26:03.350 --> 26:05.480
has been too close to Boxing.

26:17.680 --> 26:18.960
My two children

26:18.960 --> 26:20.720
have been fighting for many years.

26:20.720 --> 26:22.480
It's not decent,

26:22.720 --> 26:23.440
but

26:24.000 --> 26:26.640
it promotes

26:26.640 --> 26:28.500
the development of Lan Yue Group.

26:28.770 --> 26:29.660
Competition

26:30.310 --> 26:31.310
is always

26:31.550 --> 26:34.000
the engine to improve.

26:35.310 --> 26:36.480
Let them fight.

26:37.720 --> 26:39.790
If a competition for the chief manager

26:39.790 --> 26:41.350
of the Phase II program

26:41.830 --> 26:43.400
comes to me,

26:43.890 --> 26:45.780
I think Lan Yue

26:46.510 --> 26:48.030
will have no hope for them.

26:48.200 --> 26:48.830
Yes.

26:49.200 --> 26:49.830
Then

26:49.830 --> 26:52.480
the voting for the chief manager
of the Phase II

26:52.720 --> 26:54.650
proceeds as usual this afternoon?

26:59.750 --> 27:00.790
Unfortunately,

27:01.750 --> 27:03.550
Xixiao's attention is not here.

27:04.590 --> 27:07.000
If only Xixiao could come back,

27:07.510 --> 27:09.450
I could save a lot of trouble.

27:10.070 --> 27:11.310
This is the second thing

27:11.310 --> 27:12.920
I'm going to report to you.

27:15.070 --> 27:17.460
Xixiao went back to Lan Yue.

27:19.270 --> 27:20.070
What?

27:20.830 --> 27:21.880
Xixiao is back?

27:21.880 --> 27:22.400
Yes.

27:22.790 --> 27:24.720
This time, Xixiao

27:24.880 --> 27:26.060
led Dingshang

27:26.090 --> 27:28.020
in revising the tender in a big way.

27:28.350 --> 27:29.110
That's why we won the bidding for

27:29.110 --> 27:30.510
the Phase II program.

27:34.210 --> 27:34.970
Good.

27:36.270 --> 27:37.350
That's good.

27:37.950 --> 27:39.730
He told me that

27:40.240 --> 27:41.500
he was not interested.

27:42.090 --> 27:42.960
Why did he

27:43.240 --> 27:44.920
change his mind suddenly?

27:45.960 --> 27:47.400
Let me emphasize it again.

27:46.020 --> 27:49.800
[Lan Yue Group]

27:48.000 --> 27:49.200
I built

27:49.200 --> 27:51.550
the Phase I program of the resort.

27:52.020 --> 27:53.830
I've been making remarkable benefits

27:53.830 --> 27:55.550
for the company.

27:55.960 --> 27:56.790
To put it bluntly,

27:56.790 --> 27:58.590
the Phase I program

27:58.880 --> 28:00.810
contributed a lot to Lan Yue Group.

28:01.680 --> 28:02.680
Everybody,

28:02.680 --> 28:03.880
do you admit it?

28:04.130 --> 28:10.500
[Lan Yue Group]

28:04.270 --> 28:05.160
In the whole Lan Yue,

28:05.160 --> 28:06.110
who else is

28:06.110 --> 28:07.400
more experienced

28:07.400 --> 28:08.440
and more qualified than me to be

28:08.440 --> 28:10.300
in charge of the Phase II project?

28:12.310 --> 28:13.960
Mr. Lu, did you forget that

28:14.400 --> 28:15.510
the fire

28:15.510 --> 28:16.680
in the Phase I project last year

28:16.680 --> 28:17.640
caused hundreds of millions of loss

28:17.640 --> 28:18.840
in the whole quarter?

28:19.230 --> 28:22.760
[Lan Yue Group]

28:19.480 --> 28:21.160
The endorsement of this year's resort

28:21.160 --> 28:22.960
has a problem with the contract.

28:23.350 --> 28:24.510
As you said,

28:24.790 --> 28:26.110
the profit of the Phase I project

28:26.110 --> 28:27.830
accounted for 30% of the total profit

28:27.830 --> 28:29.000
of Lan Yue.

28:29.400 --> 28:30.590
But at the same time,

28:30.590 --> 28:31.960
you need to invest a lot of manpower,

28:31.960 --> 28:33.680
financial resources
and energy to maintain it.

28:33.680 --> 28:35.510
The Phase I project
is inseparable from you.

28:35.510 --> 28:36.070
Mr. Lu,

28:36.830 --> 28:37.720
people's energy

28:37.720 --> 28:38.880
is limited.

28:39.200 --> 28:40.000
Putting the eggs

28:40.000 --> 28:41.510
in the same basket

28:41.680 --> 28:43.200
might be too risky.

28:43.310 --> 28:45.310
Making such a big project

28:45.310 --> 28:46.590
requires rich experience

28:46.590 --> 28:47.590
and partners

28:47.590 --> 28:49.790
learning every detail in all sections.

28:51.080 --> 28:52.030
Let me tell you.

28:52.400 --> 28:54.660
We don't have the cost of trial and error.

28:55.200 --> 28:56.030
If we stick to the rules,

28:56.030 --> 28:57.880
we can't create a unique style.

28:58.110 --> 28:59.110
Pingchuan has already had

28:59.110 --> 29:00.400
Phase I project,

29:00.790 --> 29:02.110
so we don't need to create a Phase II

29:02.110 --> 29:03.240
as a copy.

29:11.240 --> 29:12.160
In my opinion,

29:13.160 --> 29:15.360
the board members have their own ideas.

29:15.590 --> 29:16.400
We don't have to

29:16.400 --> 29:17.440
waste our time.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.030
Let's vote.

29:20.640 --> 29:21.600
I'm done.

29:23.350 --> 29:24.510
Since then,

29:26.790 --> 29:28.680
let's vote now.

29:32.880 --> 29:33.810
Sorry, everyone.

29:33.810 --> 29:34.810
I'm late.

29:36.160 --> 29:36.880
No.

29:37.880 --> 29:39.440
It's time to vote.

29:41.070 --> 29:41.680
Okay.

29:42.160 --> 29:43.620
Since we're going to vote,

29:44.060 --> 29:45.400
let me say a few words.

29:45.880 --> 29:46.750
The Phase I project

29:46.750 --> 29:47.880
was built

29:47.880 --> 29:48.510
more than

29:48.510 --> 29:49.720
20 years ago.

29:50.790 --> 29:52.140
Over the past 20 years,

29:52.310 --> 29:53.200
the times

29:53.790 --> 29:55.400
and the market kept changing.

29:55.400 --> 29:56.880
The consumers' needs and preferences

29:56.880 --> 29:58.340
are constantly changing.

29:59.200 --> 29:59.720
The experience of

29:59.720 --> 30:01.160
the success of the Phase I project

30:01.160 --> 30:02.590
is precious,

30:03.350 --> 30:04.480
but I think

30:05.000 --> 30:06.200
if we want to give new momentum

30:06.200 --> 30:07.070
and more possibilities

30:07.070 --> 30:08.550
to the Phase II project,

30:10.310 --> 30:11.840
we have to embrace changes.

30:12.790 --> 30:14.160
That's all my idea as

30:14.160 --> 30:15.310
the director of the Phase II project,

30:15.310 --> 30:16.240
and the shareholders

30:16.240 --> 30:17.200
of Lan Yue Group.

30:17.220 --> 30:18.330
You can vote now.

30:23.000 --> 30:23.880
Let's vote.

30:45.400 --> 30:46.160
It's been a long time

30:46.160 --> 30:47.480
since I saw your father lose his control.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.590
Look at his gloomy face.

30:48.590 --> 30:49.680
He stormed off.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.750
Congratulations.

30:51.770 --> 30:52.830
I will finally

30:52.830 --> 30:54.530
work under the leadership of Auntie.

30:54.530 --> 30:55.740
Cut the crap.

30:57.310 --> 30:58.400
But to be honest,

30:58.790 --> 31:00.250
I really want to thank you.

31:00.510 --> 31:01.310
The board knows

31:01.310 --> 31:03.170
your importance to your grandpa.

31:03.590 --> 31:04.640
So this time,

31:07.300 --> 31:08.670
without your support,

31:09.000 --> 31:10.200
I might not win.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.200
I just did

31:13.200 --> 31:14.590
what I think is right.

31:19.000 --> 31:20.000
Mr. Lu Jr.,

31:20.370 --> 31:22.000
Mr. Lu wants to see you.

31:33.840 --> 31:36.110
Mr. Lu, Mr. Lu Jr. is here.

31:36.400 --> 31:37.400
Let him in.

31:40.000 --> 31:40.880
What is it?

31:41.960 --> 31:42.750
What is it?

31:44.120 --> 31:45.580
You're really something.

31:47.400 --> 31:48.070
As soon as you came back,

31:48.070 --> 31:50.070
you didn't go home or see your family,

31:50.070 --> 31:52.360
but came to

31:52.480 --> 31:54.160
openly oppose me, right?

31:55.720 --> 31:57.270
It sounds like

31:57.270 --> 31:59.330
you cared about me in the past decade.

31:59.880 --> 32:01.280
If you had cared about me,

32:01.510 --> 32:02.350
you would have known

32:02.350 --> 32:03.550
I would be back today.

32:04.920 --> 32:06.510
And the voting today

32:07.590 --> 32:08.650
is not against you.

32:09.000 --> 32:10.600
It has nothing to do with you.

32:11.310 --> 32:12.830
I'm just making a rational

32:12.830 --> 32:14.230
and objective analysis.

32:14.440 --> 32:15.680
Rational judgment

32:15.680 --> 32:17.050
and objective analysis?

32:17.050 --> 32:18.070
You're not

32:18.070 --> 32:19.070
targeting me?

32:20.640 --> 32:22.200
If you have guts,

32:22.200 --> 32:23.110
don't get involved

32:23.110 --> 32:24.370
in Lan Yue's business.

32:24.400 --> 32:25.590
Do you think I don't know

32:25.590 --> 32:26.070
why you're back

32:26.070 --> 32:27.000
from abroad?

32:27.000 --> 32:27.830
Aren't you doing this

32:27.830 --> 32:29.470
for Zhou Wan?

32:30.790 --> 32:31.350
All these years,

32:31.350 --> 32:32.750
I thought that

32:32.750 --> 32:33.310
you had grown up

32:33.310 --> 32:34.590
and you were mature.

32:34.720 --> 32:36.240
After all this,

32:36.240 --> 32:38.170
you are still enchanted by a woman.

32:40.200 --> 32:42.260
I thought that after all these years,

32:42.310 --> 32:43.910
you would change your hobby.

32:44.330 --> 32:46.020
After all this,

32:46.200 --> 32:47.110
what you've done is to make grandpa

32:47.110 --> 32:48.000
think highly of you.

32:48.000 --> 32:49.200
You bastard!

32:49.520 --> 32:50.280
How dare

32:50.310 --> 32:51.200
you

32:51.200 --> 32:52.330
talk to me like this?

32:53.270 --> 32:54.730
Am I not telling the truth?

32:58.640 --> 32:59.590
Are you really going to

32:59.590 --> 33:00.590
go against me?

33:04.390 --> 33:04.940
Okay.

33:09.000 --> 33:10.150
Have you ever thought about

33:10.150 --> 33:10.880
if you and I

33:10.880 --> 33:11.880
had worked together,

33:11.880 --> 33:12.640
Lan Yue

33:12.640 --> 33:14.510
would already be ours?

33:15.750 --> 33:16.510
I have no interest

33:16.510 --> 33:17.880
in Lan Yue.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.440
That's my

33:20.440 --> 33:21.680
least interest.

33:22.600 --> 33:23.270
The result today

33:23.270 --> 33:24.480
was due to

33:25.100 --> 33:26.210
one reason.

33:27.680 --> 33:29.280
You are not capable enough.

33:30.070 --> 33:31.400
You can't blame anyone.

33:32.110 --> 33:33.720
Don't take it out on me.

33:34.690 --> 33:36.230
Also, let me remind you.

33:37.050 --> 33:38.750
I'm not that kid anymore.

34:02.880 --> 34:03.680
Mr. Lu.

34:03.700 --> 34:05.500
Jiang Yan is here.

34:06.550 --> 34:07.440
You may leave.

34:07.490 --> 34:08.350
Close the door.

34:14.280 --> 34:15.030
It seems that

34:15.030 --> 34:17.489
it's not a proper time
to talk about work now.

34:22.980 --> 34:24.310
What is it? Go ahead.

34:28.409 --> 34:29.150
I've been in Lan Yue

34:29.150 --> 34:30.550
for a while.

34:30.880 --> 34:31.590
When can I

34:31.590 --> 34:33.320
officially intervene in work?

34:34.510 --> 34:35.190
If you don't come to me,

34:35.190 --> 34:36.590
I'll look for you too.

34:37.590 --> 34:39.630
The bidding for the Phase II program

34:39.630 --> 34:40.800
has been completed.

34:40.800 --> 34:42.070
It's about to start.

34:42.480 --> 34:43.960
Lu Qilan, the Executive Vice President
of the headquarters,

34:43.960 --> 34:46.020
will be the chief manager.

34:46.480 --> 34:48.480
I hope you can be

34:48.590 --> 34:49.480
the Strategic Director of the headquarters

34:49.480 --> 34:50.590
to support the program

34:50.590 --> 34:52.120
as a bridge between Phase II

34:52.230 --> 34:54.280
and the headquarters.

34:58.110 --> 34:59.510
I mean,

35:00.110 --> 35:01.630
Lu Qilan has never

35:01.630 --> 35:02.550
taken over such a big project.

35:02.550 --> 35:03.550
She is

35:03.550 --> 35:05.150
inevitably inexperienced.

35:05.710 --> 35:06.400
But

35:06.400 --> 35:07.840
the headquarters of Lan Yue

35:07.840 --> 35:09.280
can't take any risks

35:09.280 --> 35:10.760
without preparation.

35:10.760 --> 35:11.880
So, at this time,

35:11.880 --> 35:14.000
we need someone with new ideas

35:14.000 --> 35:15.880
and project experience

35:15.920 --> 35:18.250
to control the risk for the headquarters.

35:18.920 --> 35:20.230
If anything happens,

35:20.230 --> 35:22.890
the one can communicate with
the headquarters.

35:28.000 --> 35:30.110
So you recruited me to Lan Yue

35:31.070 --> 35:32.400
to be

35:32.400 --> 35:33.630
the chess piece

35:33.630 --> 35:35.550
after the failure of your election
as the chief manager,

35:35.550 --> 35:36.710
or as your spy.

35:37.070 --> 35:38.400
Business is like a battlefield.

35:38.400 --> 35:40.190
Everyone is a pawn.

35:40.710 --> 35:42.030
This is the duty

35:42.030 --> 35:43.400
of your position.

35:44.200 --> 35:44.920
If I

35:44.920 --> 35:46.000
succeed,

35:46.000 --> 35:47.630
this position will still be.

35:48.000 --> 35:49.590
Lan Yue and the board of directors

35:49.590 --> 35:51.000
won't leave

35:51.000 --> 35:52.060
the project alone.

35:52.360 --> 35:53.710
Don't worry.

35:54.400 --> 35:55.760
If you really

35:56.110 --> 35:57.780
have no ability,

35:58.110 --> 35:59.320
the person in that position

35:59.320 --> 36:00.510
is not you.

36:02.360 --> 36:03.280
I'm saying this

36:03.280 --> 36:04.550
to make you understand

36:04.550 --> 36:05.880
that I'm not helpless.

36:05.880 --> 36:07.280
I just hope

36:07.630 --> 36:08.800
it can be you.

36:19.110 --> 36:20.880
Whether you admit it or not,

36:22.110 --> 36:23.630
you

36:23.630 --> 36:24.690
are still my blood.

36:25.350 --> 36:27.430
One day, Lan Yue will be mine,

36:28.590 --> 36:31.510
which means it will be yours.

36:55.590 --> 36:56.630
Why did you suddenly

36:56.630 --> 36:57.590
ask me here?

36:59.800 --> 37:00.760
Nothing.

37:01.280 --> 37:02.440
I just feel

37:02.760 --> 37:03.360
it's been a long time

37:03.360 --> 37:04.620
since we were together

37:05.360 --> 37:06.490
when we were little.

37:09.590 --> 37:11.190
Is something bothering you?

37:15.590 --> 37:17.280
I remember when we were young,

37:18.170 --> 37:20.540
we used to be here
when having troubles.

37:23.600 --> 37:25.220
When I first met you,

37:25.510 --> 37:26.550
you squatted here

37:26.590 --> 37:28.000
and cried.

37:30.360 --> 37:31.320
Are you going to

37:31.320 --> 37:33.320
mention it for the rest of your life?

37:33.440 --> 37:34.590
I can. Why not?

37:41.250 --> 37:42.990
We were so young back then,

37:43.410 --> 37:44.940
but we had so many troubles.

37:47.650 --> 37:48.440
Yes.

37:50.480 --> 37:52.340
Now that we've grown up,

37:52.860 --> 37:53.990
I didn't expect that

37:54.820 --> 37:56.350
we would have more worries.

38:08.280 --> 38:09.520
At least we are

38:10.230 --> 38:11.280
still trying to do

38:11.280 --> 38:12.480
what we wanted to do.

38:15.190 --> 38:16.400
Your dream

38:16.550 --> 38:18.070
is coming true, right?

38:22.810 --> 38:24.160
Success and fame?

38:27.000 --> 38:27.840
Maybe

38:28.660 --> 38:30.190
it's just self-righteous.

38:32.360 --> 38:33.220
What about you?

38:34.110 --> 38:35.150
A kind person.

38:41.230 --> 38:42.590
The simpler the wish,

38:42.590 --> 38:44.030
the harder it will be.

38:48.800 --> 38:49.590
Jiang Yan.

38:51.000 --> 38:51.800
I'm entering

38:54.150 --> 38:56.150
the Phase II project team of Lan Yue.

39:04.630 --> 39:05.430
For Lu Xixiao?

39:07.170 --> 39:08.230
For other reasons.

39:14.560 --> 39:16.160
No matter what you want to do,

39:16.480 --> 39:17.550
I can help you.

39:20.930 --> 39:21.730
Thanks.

39:25.650 --> 39:27.050
But there are some things

39:28.550 --> 39:29.800
I have to do myself.

39:53.840 --> 39:55.320
How long do you need?

39:57.620 --> 39:58.300
Wan.

39:58.360 --> 39:59.590
I'm still worried.

39:59.590 --> 40:00.400
Why don't I

40:00.400 --> 40:01.070
move in with you?

40:01.070 --> 40:01.800
No need.

40:02.030 --> 40:03.690
I don't need a cleaner at home.

40:04.400 --> 40:05.110
Yes.

40:05.110 --> 40:06.400
You don't lack anything.

40:06.400 --> 40:07.400
What a fool.

40:07.800 --> 40:08.710
You should worry about

40:08.710 --> 40:10.000
your baby, Jiang Fan.

40:10.070 --> 40:10.960
He's not as lucky as you.

40:10.960 --> 40:12.070
You still have a place to live.

40:12.070 --> 40:13.920
It's none of my business.

40:19.970 --> 40:20.630
Meng.

40:20.730 --> 40:22.960
I'll leave the house to you.

40:23.190 --> 40:23.800
Go.

40:24.000 --> 40:24.800
Don't worry.

40:29.770 --> 40:31.000
Help her move it.

40:36.210 --> 40:37.000
Bad fate.

40:37.700 --> 40:39.190
Jiang Fan

40:39.220 --> 40:40.230
worked so hard

40:40.360 --> 40:42.620
but couldn't even get somewhere to live.

40:42.960 --> 40:43.820
He deserves it.

40:51.800 --> 40:52.590
Study.

40:53.190 --> 40:54.120
The living room.

40:54.630 --> 40:55.830
The bathroom is over there.

40:55.830 --> 40:56.830
I know.

40:59.010 --> 41:00.670
I'm afraid you've forgotten.

41:03.440 --> 41:04.570
Where should I stay?

41:05.770 --> 41:07.370
Live in the same room with me.

41:14.390 --> 41:15.140
What's wrong?
